1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
Smell gas inside your car?

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:04,000
The way it shows up is one clue.

3
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:07,000
Only right after fueling up?

4
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:10,000
That can point to a loose gas cap.

5
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:13,000
Smell it idling or parked?

6
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:16,000
May indicate a small fuel-line or EVAP leak.

7
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:19,000
Getting stronger while you're driving?

8
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:22,000
Pull over — worth checking before you go further.

9
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:25,000
Don't guess with a fuel smell.

10
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:28,000
